Description: Generic and Expansible System Simulator
 GenESyS is a C++ simulation platform designed as an extensible
 architecture for modeling and simulation.
 .
 This single package installs the complete supported GenESyS system base:
 the Qt graphical interface, command-line shell, HTTP worker, legacy web
 compatibility command, stable Launcher and Dispatcher, administrative
 update policy, desktop integration, and the Debian-provided system fallback
 runtime. The public genesys-mcp dispatcher entry point is also installed;
 the Python MCP system fallback remains intentionally outside this Debian
 build contract.
